                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f2c87244-2008-3292-a11a-5a734eead1af",
                        "entry_id": "9638e6f5-65fe-3c7a-85a9-53185ff76de2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "орнитол. хищная птица из семейства соколиных (Falco rusticolus)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2e83ea25-98c8-4cf4-8406-d773eeba4a54",
                                "sense_id": "f2c87244-2008-3292-a11a-5a734eead1af",
                                "text": "В подарок главнокомандующему они вручили мне во 100 рублей иноходца и обученного кречета (белого ястреба), стоящего там 40 червонных."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3019e245-0ca8-4223-8226-023c82321522",
                                "sense_id": "f2c87244-2008-3292-a11a-5a734eead1af",
                                "text": "Хорошо ещё, что воро́ны плодущи, а то кто бы кречету, да ястребу, да беркуту дань платил?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "88e1e662-863a-4379-9e6d-b95108dcc05c",
                                "sense_id": "f2c87244-2008-3292-a11a-5a734eead1af",
                                "text": "Царь стравил кречета на голубя, и только бы кречету броситься ― голубь в яблоко обратился, а кречет обратился в старика…"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2396888b-3c98-480f-ba27-eee7cf83dde8",
                        "source_entry_id": "9638e6f5-65fe-3c7a-85a9-53185ff76de2",
                        "source_sense_id": "f2c87244-2008-3292-a11a-5a734eead1af",
                        "target_lang_word": "gyrfalcon",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gyrfalcon",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "05f1da4d-2971-35d2-82d6-49380a7fa522",
                                        "entry_id": "320c3c0d-df5c-3ace-9ccd-a7897db8c48a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any large falcon, especially as used to fly at herons."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b4686eaa-9df2-4604-b6df-3b2a8d77650f",
                                                "sense_id": "05f1da4d-2971-35d2-82d6-49380a7fa522",
                                                "text": "For I obſerve, that all vvomen of your condition are like the vvomen of the Play-houſe, ſtill Piquing at each other, vvho ſhall go the beſt Dreſt, and in the Richeſt Habits: till you vvork up one another by your high flying, as the Heron and Jerfalcon do."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3da29cae-9cb2-36ed-84c1-40baaf4e9944",
                                        "entry_id": "320c3c0d-df5c-3ace-9ccd-a7897db8c48a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Falco rusticolus, a large bird of prey that breeds on Arctic coasts and islands of North America, Europe and Asia."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5176884a-6e90-49f2-9e0c-d81cab5e82c2",
                                                "sense_id": "3da29cae-9cb2-36ed-84c1-40baaf4e9944",
                                                "text": "[T]he usurper Buljan ordered that his sukkah be erected on the donjon's roof, with its […] relative nearness to the stars, among which his sky-worshiping and uncircumcised ancestors still hunted with infallible gyrfalcons for celestial game."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "abd8befa-a2b5-42ee-873c-edaec2c50aa3",
                        "source_entry_id": "9638e6f5-65fe-3c7a-85a9-53185ff76de2",
                        "source_sense_id": "f2c87244-2008-3292-a11a-5a734eead1af",
